{
  "title": "The Strongest Four-Sword Style Streamer: Since the VR Game I Poured My Life into Became Reality, I'm Going to Use My Class that was Supposed to be Abolished to Become Unrivaled",
  "description": "Without warning, the real world synced with the game. Towers and dungeons materialized globally—now, conquer them with Quad-Wielding!\n\nHayate, a solo player of the ultra-popular VRMMO FWO, cherished his obscure class: Quad-Wielder. But his world shattered when he received the worst possible news: \"Quad-Wielding will be removed!\" Teamed up with Elena, a chaebol heiress and archer, Hayate unleashes his ultimate Quad-Wielding technique \"Obscuring Moon\"—all while unraveling the mysteries of the Creation Goddess. Then suddenly... the game and reality merge.",
  "artist": "Gashitani",
  "author": "Kizuka Maya",
